                        "source_entry_id": "d40f8fce-8347-3f0e-a7bd-86d875ec4415",
                        "source_sense_id": "8cc4c27d-00d9-3e1c-abf0-c89b045f6bb1",
                        "source_sense_description": "zonder sociaal besef",
                        "target_lang_word": "unsocial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unsocial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af905d01-5c2d-38c9-876d-4d9e882c26bd",
                                        "entry_id": "eb22d2e8-0a30-35d2-8345-fc127e4647f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not social."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "488b8b16-761e-40c3-ba21-a562997365a0",
                                                "sense_id": "af905d01-5c2d-38c9-876d-4d9e882c26bd",
                                                "text": "The municipal corporations of that universal kingdom are not morally at liberty at their pleasure, and on their speculations of a contingent improvement, wholly to separate and tear asunder the bands of their subordinate community, and to dissolve it into an unsocial, uncivil, unconnected chaos of elementary principles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2acc3fd3-27ac-4bec-a9bb-aac46d9dc0d5",
                                                "sense_id": "af905d01-5c2d-38c9-876d-4d9e882c26bd",
                                                "text": "He went to London, though he would have preferred remaining in the country; he gave a grand fête of some description or other every year, though he hated the noise and confusion; he filled his house with company, though his habits were even unsocial: in short, his whole life was one succession of sacrifices, but they were sacrifices without merit—they were the sacrifices of weakness, not of strength."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c89f7050-1c80-4c41-8117-171bfb74eb9e",
                                                "sense_id": "af905d01-5c2d-38c9-876d-4d9e882c26bd",
                                                "text": "The process which, if not checked, will abolish Man, goes on apace among Communists and Democrats no less than among Fascists. […] Once we killed bad men: now we liquidate unsocial elements."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42225067-da54-37dd-b5be-44e0dde1ddfd",
                                        "entry_id": "eb22d2e8-0a30-35d2-8345-fc127e4647f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not seeking or showing the desire for the company of others; inhospitable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4161396b-7e70-4bd7-a3b1-f14bf9881735",
                                                "sense_id": "42225067-da54-37dd-b5be-44e0dde1ddfd",
                                                "text": "The cupbearer shrugged up his shoulders in displeasure. \"I thought to have lodged him in the solere chamber,\" said he; \"but since he is so unsocial to Christians, e'en let him take the next stall to Isaac the Jew's."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4e54e5fe-347f-4c9a-9488-0406568d00a6",
                        "source_entry_id": "d40f8fce-8347-3f0e-a7bd-86d875ec4415",
                        "source_sense_id": "8cc4c27d-00d9-3e1c-abf0-c89b045f6bb1",
                        "source_sense_description": "zonder sociaal besef",
                        "target_lang_word": "asocial",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "asocial",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5537b80e-07b3-31d7-a0bc-7105903b7150",
                                        "entry_id": "521cc01f-b830-3b95-b7b4-a14d16818812",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui n'est pas sociable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13b2945d-18ba-418f-8146-3cc76396279d",
                                                "sense_id": "5537b80e-07b3-31d7-a0bc-7105903b7150",
                                                "text": "Asocial ce n'est pas pardonnable. Cette année. Avec la pollution, tout ça. On ne s'en fait pas ; l'année prochaine ça va peut-être être la grande mode."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1164212-a832-4e08-9772-4706ce0977d2",
                                                "sense_id": "5537b80e-07b3-31d7-a0bc-7105903b7150",
                                                "text": "La famille rend asocial. Heureusement qu’il y a les célibataires, les divorcés, les veuves et les homosexuels pour créer une société."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96f9e516-67cf-4fe6-b9c9-c64589d8885b",
                                                "sense_id": "5537b80e-07b3-31d7-a0bc-7105903b7150",
                                                "text": "Par ailleurs, selon Vannini, la manière dont Hollywood a caricaturé le “codeur” (en mâle blanc et asocial qui pianote d’abord et réfléchit après) n’aide pas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11e353e8-f24d-3535-abeb-2207616a19c5",
                                        "entry_id": "521cc01f-b830-3b95-b7b4-a14d16818812",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pour une espèce ou une essence, dont un représentant ne tolère pas ou mal la présence de congénères à proximité immédiate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f3392d0-9bb8-4bca-9166-1b006390c399",
                                                "sense_id": "11e353e8-f24d-3535-abeb-2207616a19c5",
                                                "text": "Le merisier est une essence asociale qui ne craint pas le froid dans les plaines et collines."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
